### Create Payment for Ticket
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TICKET",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "amount": 15.50,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Create Payment for Abonnement
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "ABONNEMENT",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Get Payment by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/api/payments/1

### Get Payments by User ID
GET http://localhost:4004/api/payments/user/1

### Stripe Webhook (Payment Success) - For Testing Only
### Note: In production, this endpoint receives requests from Stripe with proper signature
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
stripe-signature: test_signature

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_test_123",
      "object": "payment_intent",
      "amount": 1550,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "succeeded"
    }
  }
}

### Stripe Webhook (Payment Failed) - For Testing Only
POST http://localhost:4004/api/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
stripe-signature: test_signature

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook_failed",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payment_intent.payment_failed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_test_456",
      "object": "payment_intent",
      "amount": 5000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "requires_payment_method"
    }
  }
}
